  "statement": "I appreciate the ongoing dialogue regarding the simultaneous borrowing limits. However, I believe maintaining a maximum of 5 simultaneous borrow operations is essential for upholding fairness and accountability. While I acknowledge the proposal for 6 operations, I worry that this may still compromise the integrity of our borrowing policies. To find a middle ground, I propose a synthesis: allow a maximum of 5 simultaneous borrow operations but implement a system that monitors and reports on resource utilization to ensure that we can adapt to future needs without compromising our ethical obligations. I still firmly oppose the removal of RES-01 for essential data protection compliance.",
